{"id": 9301, "modified_gmt": "2026-11-16T17:18:04", "meta": {"_acf_changed": false, "footnotes": "", "_elementor_edit_mode": "builder", "_elementor_template_type": "wp-page", "_elementor_data": "[{\"id\": \"1711ad7\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"93da1da\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><div class=\\\"hero phero\\\">\\n  <img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-hero-road.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cigala Cycling Tours Lake Garda\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"crumbs\\\"><a href=\\\"/\\\">Home</a> / <a href=\\\"/trips/\\\">Bike tours</a> / Road tours</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pill-eyebrow\\\">2027 season \\u00b7 road</div>\\n    <h1>Road Bike Tours</h1>\\n    <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"lede\\\"><p>Road cycling is where Cigala Cycling Tours began. Our road bike tours take you over the climbs that made the Giro d\\u2019Italia and the Tour de France famous: the Stelvio, Gavia and Mortirolo in the Italian Alps, the Giau and Sella Ronda passes in the Dolomites, the Galibier and Alpe d\\u2019Huez in the French Alps, and the Vr\\u0161i\\u010d Pass in Slovenia.</p><p>Every trip is guided by former pro riders who handle the routes, logistics and bike support, so all you need to do is ride. From relaxed lakeside days on Lake Garda to big mountain weeks, there is a road tour for every level.</p></div>\\n    <p class=\\\"lede\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Can\\u2019t find the perfect one? Build your own tour. Find out more\\u00a0<a href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">HERE</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</div></div>\"}, \"elements\":