tent/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-dolomites.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Dolomites Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Dolomites</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Dolomites, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-08\\\">8\\u201313 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>290 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>8,200 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>On this trip you will ride in one of the most spectacular places on Earth.</p><p>The Dolomites are so mystical and mind-blowing. Everywhere you look, it's a postcard. You will climb some of Italy's famous and beautiful climb: Giau, Gardena, Sella, Pordoi, Campolongo, Falzarego, Valparola, Fedaia, Tre Cime di Lavaredo and San Pellegrino.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1499 | \\u00a31349 | $1749*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/dolomites/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=9944206554&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"intermediate\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italian-alps/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-italian-alps-1.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Italian Alps Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Italian Alps</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Bormio, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-15\\\">15\\u201320 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>380 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>10,200 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Take on an unforgettable cycling holiday in the Italian Alps, conquering some of the most legendary climbs in cycling history. Ride the iconic roads of the Giro d'Italia, including the Stelvio, Gavia, Mortirolo, Cancano and Foscagno. Each climb offers its own unique challenge, spectacular alpine scenery and an incredible sense of achievement, making this the ultimate trip for riders looking to experience Italy's most famous mountain passes.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1549*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italian-alps/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=5899565803&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"intermediate\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/french-alps/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-french-alps.webp\\\" alt=\\\"French Alps Bike Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-fr.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of France\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>French Alps</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">French Alps, France</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-28\\\">28 Jul \\u2013 4 Aug 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">7 nights/ 8 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>485 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>13,700 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Take on an unforgettable cycling holiday in the French Alps, conquering legendary climbs including Col du Galibier, Alpe D'Huez, Col de la Madeleine, Col de la Croix de Fer, Col d'Izoard and the Cime de la Bonette \\u2014 the highest paved road in the Alps. Each climb offers its own challenge and spectacular scenery, making this the ultimate trip for riders looking to experience France's most iconic mountain passes.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1799 | \\u00a31549 | $2099*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/french-alps/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=5458779222&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/wonderful-slovenia/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-wonderful-slovenia.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Wonderful Slovenia Bike Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-si.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Slovenia\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Wonderful Slovenia</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">West Slovenia, Slovenia</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-08-31\\\">31 Aug \\u2013 6 Sep 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">6 nights/7 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>440 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>6,600 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Discover one of Europe's most underrated cycling destinations. This road trip takes you from the dramatic Julian Alps, over the legendary 24 hairpins of the Vr\\u0161i\\u010d Pass, down through the turquoise waters of the So\\u010da Valley, and along the shores of Lake Bled. A journey through Slovenia's most spectacular landscapes in a single trip, this is the ultimate way to experience a country most cyclists have never had on their radar.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1499 | \\u00a31349 | $1749*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/04</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/wonderful-slovenia/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=1761100244&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-and-stelvio/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-lake-garda-and-stelvio.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Lake Garda Bike Tour | Cigala Cycling\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Lake Garda &amp; Day Trip to Stelvio</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Lake Garda, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-09-07\\\">7\\u201312 Sep 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>460 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>4,000 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>One of our most popular trip.</p><p>Ride in the amazing routes around Lake Garda. Experience the amazing cuisine of the area and immerse yourself in the culture. Finally, on this trip you will have the opportunity to have a day trip and ride Italy's most famous climb: Passo Dello Stelvio!</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1099 | \\u00a3999 | $1299*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/04</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-and-stelvio/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=9061141280&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"road\\\" data-level=\\\"beginner\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italys-coast-to-coast/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-italys-coast-to-coast.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Italy&#x27;s Coast to Coast bike tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Road</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Italy's Coast to Coast</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Tuscany, Umbria, Marche, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-09-24\\\">24 Sep \\u2013 1 Oct 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">7 nights/8 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>470 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>4,600 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i></i><i></i></span>Level: Beginner, Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>An incredible cycling experience, from coast to coast through the heart of Italy: this road bike tour will take you on unique ride, from the Tyrrhenian Sea to the Adriatic Sea.</p><p>You will be riding through the most amazing countryside: rolling hills, apennine mountains, hidden medieval villages surrounded by unspoiled nature.</p><p>Covering three regions in 6 riding days: Tuscany, Umbria &amp; Marche.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1649 | \\u00a31449 | $1899*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/05</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/italys-coast-to-coast/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=3772123174&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n    </div><p class=\\\"lvnone\\\" hidden>No tour here for this level yet. <a href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">Ask us for a custom tour</a> and we will plan one for you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section></div>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"eb36ecb\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"